Subject: [PATCH] Dante2iOS: nxnative 93c76c1cbf41 - Trim idle Metal staging
 buffers on opt in

Upstream-Status: pending
Reason: Isolated nxnative runtime fix: Trim idle Metal staging buffers on opt in; full HEAD rebase remains blocked by shared-shell conflicts
Issue: seedds/nxnative@93c76c1cbf4121f2609f24eaa0d2cafec9bb04c7

---
 dm/gfx/nvn/nvn_mtl.m         |  82 +++++++++++++++++++++++++-
 dm/gfx/tests/Makefile        |   8 +++
 dm/gfx/tests/t_upload_idle.m | 110 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
